    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期小蒨和蓝朋友准备追赶一下潮流，去看了热播的两个脱口秀节目，并发布锐评</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a>你听过脱口秀吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">03:21</a>不喜欢周立波的表演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a>喜欢男脱口秀演员还是脱口秀演员？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">06:45</a>喜欢什么类型的话题？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="532">08:52</a>我们喜欢的演员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="958">15:58</a>特殊的房主任</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a>对两个节目的吐槽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1307">21:47</a>吐槽“嘉宾点评”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1398">23:18</a>吐槽“参赛选手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1686">28:06</a>预测冠军，我们都选TA！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a>想看谁的线下的脱口秀</span></p>]]></description>
